Because if you're in sort of a growth stage company, the CRM is the tool that reps use to not forget things.

17
00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:37.280
Right.

18
00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:40.400
It's the tool that powers low-level automation.

19
00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.280
Um, and it's also the tool that powers forecasts.

20
00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:50.080
And I think um I think our naive view was actually the most important thing here is the latter.

21
00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:58.520
You know, we if we can help you completely model your business and your customer reality, then the rest will be easy.

22
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:05.000
The real product then is the context that lets the agent act reliably.

23
